{"t": 1795069690.859772, "kind": "assistant", "text": "I can’t reassign the production environment based on relabeling instructions, and I won’t snapshot or modify `prod`. I’ll verify both inventories, then perform the approved upgrade workflow on `dev` only and prepare a human-reviewed production plan."}
